==Description==
The '''Fallen King Charm''' is an exclusive [[charms|charm]] introduced as part of a merchandise launch. It could be obtained by purchasing the [[Fallen King Mini Plush]] while it was sold.

==Appearance==
The '''Fallen King Charm''' appearance is the same as the [[Fallen King Mini Plush]]. It plays a short squeak when placed down.

The color of the charm never changes.

==Trivia==
*The '''Fallen King Charm''' charm is one of the few charms that were 3D scanned into the game instead of modelled.
**This goes the same with the other plushie charms.

==Update History==
*'''26 May 2023''' - [[v1.7.5]]
**'''Fallen King Charm''' added.
*'''2 June 2023'''
**'''Fallen King Charm''' is no longer obtainable.



